# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Optional kicker costs expose their Forge description before payment.
# Forcing: Centaur Courser survives two damage but dies to the kicked four damage.
# AI behavior: Empty opposing hand leaves targeting and resolution uncontested.
# Protocol path: Cast, optional kicker or Done, targeting, mana payment and resolution.
# Failure modes: Generic cost label, wrong branch payment, wrong damage or stalled continuation.
# Card roles: Shivan Fire offers kicker; five Mountains fund either cast; Centaur Courser distinguishes outcomes; Ornithopter checks targeting; Island retains post-resolution priority.
